// Experiment p1. Observation only. EMULATOR-ONLY.
// The behaviour hook is the accepted T3l hook: entry copies nothing, an FF
// mirror field becomes descriptor 0, and exit clears the flag and restores
// the zone byte. Nothing else is written. This run reproduces the smallest
// defect sequence (AF-ON entry, one move, exit, normal entry, dial) and
// records the reads that feed the position at the dial, against K2.
// Do not edit this file after it has run.
// Usage: node26 work/scripts/leak_p1.mjs om-emu
